WEBVTT

00:07:27.833 --> 00:07:30.875
there is a thought experiment
that you can do.

00:07:32.542 --> 00:07:34.809
Because here's the truth.

00:07:34.833 --> 00:07:36.143
You know.

00:07:36.167 --> 00:07:38.458
You already know.

00:07:39.458 --> 00:07:41.476
So ask yourself this:

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:46.393
Would you, would you really
want your son or your daughter,

00:07:46.417 --> 00:07:48.851
your brother or your sister,

00:07:48.875 --> 00:07:52.976
to marry a practicing Muslim
from the Middle East?

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:57.875
Or someone recently arrived
from South Asia, who is a Hindu?

00:07:58.833 --> 00:08:02.601
Or an asylum seeker
from Sub-Saharan Africa?